&lt;a href="Median"&gt;Median&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="mode"&gt;mode&lt;/a&gt;, sarta &lt;a href="interquartile%20mean"&gt;interquartile mean&lt;/a&gt; mangrupa ukuran lokasi oge. Keur ngajelaskeun &lt;a href="dispersi%20statistik"&gt;dispersi statistik&lt;/a&gt;, urang bisa maké &lt;a href="rentang%20%28statistik%29"&gt;rentang&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="interquartile%20range"&gt;interquartile range&lt;/a&gt;, atawa &lt;a href="simpangan%20mutlak"&gt;simpangan mutlak&lt;/a&gt;.
